KORTEX PAST EXAMINATION PAPERS
WAEC - Biology (Year 2022)

Q1. In a cross between two heterozygous tall pea plants (Tt), what is the probability of dwarf offspring (tt)?
  (A) 0%
  (B) 25%
  (C) 50%
  (D) 75%
  Answer: B - Monohybrid cross Tt x Tt produces 1 TT : 2 Tt : 1 tt (1/4 = 25% dwarf).


